Tests end-to-end PCA thinking under real-time, multi-tenant constraints with practical privacy and latency trade-offs.

## Key Concepts
- Incremental PCA for streaming data
- Per-tenant preprocessing and privacy
- Loadings-to-alert mappings and latency budgeting

## Code Example
